1
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:23,800
Ming.

2
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,870
Check if the TV signal is back.

3
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,320
It is, Dad. It's back.

4
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,920
Okay. Let me tighten it a little more.

5
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:32,880
Qin.

6
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,600
Qin, are you okay? Qin.

7
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:37,470
Ming, I'm fine.

8
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:41,520
I was just fixing the satellite dish

9
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,320
and forgot about the time we agreed on.

10
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,880
Dad, are you okay?

11
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,670
I couldn't reach you just now.

12
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,470
I thought something had happened to you.

13
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:53,750
I'm fine.

14
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:57,920
Maybe you couldn't get through

15
00:00:58,350 --> 00:00:59,390
because I was talking to Ming just now.

16
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:01,750
I see.

17
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:04,680
Dad, have you found any leads?

18
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,560
Right.

19
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:09,350
A man named Li Daguo confessed.

20
00:01:09,870 --> 00:01:10,710
But

21
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:13,280
his statement and the way
he described the crime

22
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,430
don't match the evidence at all.

23
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,400
I don't think he's the suspect.

24
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,590
That's right. Li Daguo isn't the killer.

25
00:01:18,590 --> 00:01:20,840
The Rainy Night Hammer
Killer Case still remains unsolved.

26
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,640
But why did Li Daguo confess?

27
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,000
Well,

28
00:01:24,430 --> 00:01:27,120
he was also a victim of the Urban Construction
Group fundraising case.

29
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,870
He lost a great deal of money.

30
00:01:28,950 --> 00:01:31,310
Basically, he wanted to use this

31
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:32,310
as a way to end his life.

32
00:01:32,950 --> 00:01:35,350
By the way,
we also looked into Jin Juan.

33
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:37,480
And guess what?

34
00:01:38,070 --> 00:01:40,510
She was involved
in the Longfan fundraising case.

35
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:41,790
Any other leads?

36
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,070
Zhou's autopsy report is out.

37
00:01:44,070 --> 00:01:45,560
Huo Qicheng's time of death

38
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,000
was 10:30 PM on the night of the murder.

39
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:49,760
It was pouring that night,

40
00:01:49,790 --> 00:01:51,510
but the rain stopped at 11 PM.

41
00:01:51,510 --> 00:01:53,280
From 10:30 to 11,

42
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:55,040
there was a half-hour window.

43
00:01:55,230 --> 00:01:56,870
Right. So I think

44
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,430
that half hour

45
00:01:58,480 --> 00:02:00,680
was when the killer staged the scene.

46
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,350
That means tire tracks or footprints

47
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,870
may still have been left at the scene.

48
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:13,620
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 4=

49
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,240
Mom.

50
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,360
Drink your milk.

51
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,560
Don't keep taking sleeping pills.

52
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:23,870
Thanks, Mom.

53
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,750
This photo...

54
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,430
This photo has always been here.

55
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,910
What's wrong?

56
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:48,030
No. It's nothing.

57
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:51,240
Get some rest.

58
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,630
Get up.

59
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:23,590
Come play with me.

60
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,310
Dad.

61
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:28,080
Dad.

62
00:03:28,870 --> 00:03:30,840
Get up.

63
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,520
Get up and play with me.

64
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:38,310
Dad.

65
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:50,310
♪The hopes I hid away
when we parted that year♪

66
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:57,870
♪The buttons worn smooth
by the passing years♪

67
00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:03,250
♪Silently wishing you well
year after year♪

68
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,310
(Qin Tian)

69
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,840
(Why do memories
that never existed before)

70
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:13,470
(keep flooding back to me?)

71
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:17,270
(Is this a dream or reality?)

72
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,380
(Why does everything I feel)

73
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,430
(seem so real I can almost touch it?)

74
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:28,030
♪I haven't let you down♪

75
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:38,270
Why has Captain Qin been
so suspicious of everything lately?

76
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:40,000
He insisted we come back
and check the place again.

77
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,430
What clues could possibly be left here?

78
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:43,000
If Captain Qin sent us back here,

79
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,160
he must have his reasons.

80
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,240
And this killer,

81
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,120
after killing Huo Qicheng
in the pouring rain,

82
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,430
stayed here with him for quite a while.

83
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,720
That's seriously disturbing.

84
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:56,390
Good thing the killer did that.

85
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:58,920
If he'd left in a hurry
right after the murder,

86
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,390
with the heavy rain that night,

87
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:02,480
all the evidence
would've been washed away.

88
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:12,830
Li.

89
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,390
Look at this.

90
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,560
What did you find?

91
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,630
Looks like a motorcycle.

92
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:22,310
A motorcycle?

93
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,870
Looks like a pretty big one.

94
00:05:49,070 --> 00:05:49,870
What?

95
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:53,390
Is Section Chief Qin planning
to buy a vintage motorcycle?

96
00:05:53,510 --> 00:05:55,600
As far as I know,
he can't even ride one.

97
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:57,920
Ming.

98
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:00,870
Ming.

99
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,680
You can't ride without a license.

100
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,920
Aren't you two busy?

101
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,630
Not at all.

102
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,600
We're just concerned about you.

103
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:14,870
Then do me a favor.

104
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,830
Show some concern for the case, okay?

105
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:31,380
(Haoda)

106
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:33,270
On the night of the heavy rain,

107
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,240
there really was a motorcycle.

108
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,920
I'd invited a few friends over
to play mahjong that night.

109
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:40,070
The rain was so heavy
that we played a couple more rounds.

110
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:44,830
Then I heard this loud engine noise.

111
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,870
It was so noisy.

112
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:47,070
So I went outside to take a look.

113
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:50,750
A big, shiny

114
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:52,000
red motorcycle

115
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,160
sped right past.

116
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:55,120
A red motorcycle? Are you sure?

117
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,160
I'm sure.

118
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,870
It was a beautiful motorcycle.

119
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,680
I'd wanted to buy one myself before.

120
00:06:59,830 --> 00:07:01,360
And that motorcycle

121
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,160
had been to our complex before.

122
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:06,510
It was ridden by a very beautiful

123
00:07:06,510 --> 00:07:07,240
woman.

124
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,160
She really stood out.

125
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:09,630
She...

126
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,310
She parked right across
from Mr. Huo's house.

127
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,160
I have to say,

128
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:17,720
Mr. Huo was quite something.

129
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:19,950
He used to invite us over to his place,

130
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:22,000
and he always
had beautiful women with him.

131
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,310
Beautiful women?

132
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,070
That's right.

133
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,870
So many women came
and went from his place.

134
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:27,800
Because of that,

135
00:07:28,070 --> 00:07:31,040
his wife even came here
and had fights with him.

136
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,630
But later on,

137
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:33,830
she just stopped caring.

138
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:35,800
Did you get all that down?

139
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,800
Let's go see Jin Juan.

140
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,870
She may have seen her.

141
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,040
Thank you.

142
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:41,830
Thanks.

143
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:04,120
We're from the Public Security Bureau
Criminal Investigation Unit.

144
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:07,360
You're Jin Juan, right?

145
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:10,630
Have you ever seen a woman

146
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:12,680
riding a red motorcycle

147
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,190
to Huo Qicheng's house?

148
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,040
A woman on a red motorcycle?

149
00:08:24,510 --> 00:08:26,360
He had so many women
he couldn't even keep track of them.

150
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,120
Why would I care what they rode?

151
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,910
Your husband is dead.

152
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,320
Aren't you

153
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,360
sad?

154
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,200
Sad?

155
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,240
I've already had my share of heartbreak.

156
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:48,000
Nothing can hurt me anymore.

157
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,750
Anything else?

158
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:52,550
If not,

159
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:54,030
I'm taking my young friend here

160
00:08:54,030 --> 00:08:54,840
shopping.

161
00:08:58,270 --> 00:08:59,080
Come on.

162
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,510
Let's go, kid.

163
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:11,240
Captain Qin.

164
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:13,080
Look, my dad just got me this Phoenix.

165
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,670
Why don't you get a new one too?

166
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:16,270
Stop riding that beat-up Forever.

167
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:18,000
Even the chain is exposed.

168
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:19,440
I have a son to support.

169
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,910
Unlike you, living off your parents.

170
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,390
And that Jin Juan,

171
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:23,870
I'm telling you,

172
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:25,790
she's definitely
not as innocent as she looks.

173
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,670
But Li Daguo and Zhuang Haitao

174
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:29,840
can barely afford to eat.

175
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,120
Don't you think so, Cap...

176
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,000
This...

177
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,030
Captain Qin.

178
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,360
The red motorcycle.

179
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,120
We found it.

180
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:41,200
A 125.

181
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:42,870
I've never even gotten
my hands on one before.

182
00:09:48,390 --> 00:09:49,270
The tread pattern,

183
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,030
texture,

184
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:54,750
and width

185
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,240
all match.

186
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,320
Are you sure?

187
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,120
I'm sure.

188
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,360
This bike is a beauty.

189
00:10:05,030 --> 00:10:06,670
The woman riding it must be too.

190
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,720
Captain Qin, why don't we

191
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,080
go meet her?

192
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,510
Hello.

193
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:14,870
Hello. How can I help you?

194
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,240
We're from
the Criminal Investigation Unit.

195
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,270
I'd like to ask

196
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:21,670
who owns the red motorcycle outside.

197
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,480
It... It belongs to our boss.

198
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,360
Is something wrong, Officer?

199
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:26,600
Where's your boss? What's her name?

200
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,360
Our boss is Zhang Tiantian.

201
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:30,200
She's been hospitalized
with gastroenteritis recently.

202
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,200
She hasn't been discharged yet.

203
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,150
Where does she live?

204
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,270
She usually lives upstairs.

205
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,910
Would it be all right
if we went up and took a look?

206
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:39,480
Go ahead.

207
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,390
Okay, thank you.

208
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,270
Thank you.

209
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,750
There's nothing suspicious here.

210
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,550
No raincoat,

211
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:08,080
and no hammer or any other
potential murder weapon.

212
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,120
Should we

213
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,390
search again?

214
00:11:12,750 --> 00:11:15,270
I don't think that's necessary.

215
00:11:15,270 --> 00:11:16,390
Are you serious?

216
00:11:16,870 --> 00:11:18,750
You could search ten times
and still find nothing.

217
00:11:19,550 --> 00:11:20,510
With your level of reasoning,

218
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,510
if every suspect thought like you,

219
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,150
we would've solved this case long ago.

220
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:28,840
You think she'd leave the tools
she used in the crime upstairs?

221
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,630
Captain Qin.

222
00:11:32,270 --> 00:11:33,320
Look at that motorcycle.

223
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:35,390
It's really impressive.

224
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:37,200
I was too embarrassed
to say it downstairs,

225
00:11:38,270 --> 00:11:39,120
but even that storage box

226
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,240
looks imported to me.

227
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,200
I've never seen one like it.

228
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:42,910
Imagine if I rode this

229
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:44,870
to work.

230
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:47,550
I'd be solving cases in no time.

231
00:11:52,750 --> 00:11:54,630
You really haven't seen much, have you?

232
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:59,030
As if you have.

233
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:05,120
Captain Qin, why don't
we go to the hospital first

234
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:06,600
and question Zhang Tiantian?

235
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:11,600
What a great bike.

236
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:14,670
A 125.

237
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:17,220
The more I look at it,
the more I like it.

238
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,670
Was this mark here earlier?

239
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:29,000
Definitely not.

240
00:12:46,550 --> 00:12:47,960
The Technical Unit
and forensic examination reports

241
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:48,910
are both out.

242
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,240
The blood on the hammerhead is type O,

243
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:53,080
an exact match
for Huo Qicheng's blood type.

244
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:56,670
The wound pattern also matches
the fracture lines on Huo Qicheng's skull

245
00:12:56,670 --> 00:12:57,670
perfectly.

246
00:12:57,870 --> 00:13:00,200
And the distinctive pattern
on this raincoat

247
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,600
also perfectly matches
the padding impressions

248
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,600
left on the victim's face.

249
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,600
Based on the physical evidence,

250
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,440
the chain of evidence is complete.

251
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,240
What about the suspect?

252
00:13:09,670 --> 00:13:10,840
Zhang Tiantian has been brought in.

253
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,480
She's in the interrogation room now.

254
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,120
However,

255
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:16,750
the Technical Unit's fingerprint
comparison results are also back.

256
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,840
The fingerprints
on the hammer and raincoat

257
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:20,120
don't belong to Zhang Tiantian.

258
00:13:21,150 --> 00:13:22,150
We've also verified

259
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:23,670
that on the night
Huo Qicheng was killed,

260
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:25,510
Zhang Tiantian was hospitalized
for acute gastroenteritis

261
00:13:25,510 --> 00:13:27,240
at the city's Second People's Hospital.

262
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,150
The attending doctor,

263
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:31,030
as well as the patients
in her ward, can confirm it.

264
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,870
She has a solid alibi.

265
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,080
She's not the killer.

266
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,720
Then why were the murder weapons
on her motorcycle?

267
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,720
We also looked into
Zhang Tiantian's connections.

268
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,030
She and Jin Juan
are from the same hometown.

269
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,670
The purchase records

270
00:13:42,670 --> 00:13:43,600
for her red Honda motorcycle show

271
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,550
that Jin Juan paid for it.

272
00:13:44,550 --> 00:13:46,240
And as for her Beauty Clothing Store,

273
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,000
both the startup funds and the lease

274
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,630
were handled by Jin Juan.

275
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:51,000
There's another important lead.

276
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,390
The Technical Unit recovered
a latent blood fingerprint

277
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:54,150
from the end of the hammer handle.

278
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:55,790
It's an exact match
for Jin Juan's fingerprint.

279
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:57,000
If that's the case,

280
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,600
the prime suspect
in Huo Qicheng's murder

281
00:13:58,870 --> 00:13:59,770
should be Jin Juan.

282
00:13:59,770 --> 00:14:00,790
Take Jin Juan into custody immediately.

283
00:14:00,790 --> 00:14:01,750
We've already sent officers.

284
00:14:01,750 --> 00:14:02,360
This is bad.

285
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,550
Captain Qin, this is bad.

286
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:05,600
Chief Zhao is here too.

287
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:06,910
What happened?

288
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:09,000
There's something
I'm not sure I should say.

289
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,000
Go ahead.

290
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,030
Just say it.

291
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:18,870
What?

292
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,080
Jin Juan is missing.

293
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:21,840
Missing?

294
00:14:23,390 --> 00:14:24,720
Find her, quickly.

295
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,960
Qin, did you catch the suspect?

296
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:31,750
She must be in hiding.

297
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,750
Don't worry.
We've deployed more officers.

298
00:14:34,030 --> 00:14:35,270
A wanted notice has been issued too.

299
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:36,150
We should

300
00:14:37,150 --> 00:14:38,120
catch her soon.

301
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:40,080
That's great.

302
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,030
Ming.

303
00:14:41,870 --> 00:14:43,080
There's something I want to ask you.

304
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:45,440
When did I die again?

305
00:14:46,270 --> 00:14:47,480
When I was sixteen,

306
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,960
you died of stomach cancer.

307
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:53,360
So, Dad, from now on,

308
00:14:53,390 --> 00:14:54,670
you have to get a checkup every year

309
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:56,150
and keep an eye on your stomach.

310
00:14:58,670 --> 00:14:59,510
That's a relief.

311
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,670
As long as my failure to catch her

312
00:15:01,670 --> 00:15:03,440
didn't cause
some kind of butterfly effect.

313
00:15:06,870 --> 00:15:07,670
Ming.

314
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,480
How is your mom

315
00:15:12,870 --> 00:15:14,030
in 2020?

316
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,030
Don't worry.

317
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,750
She's still single.

318
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,120
It's just...

319
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,200
Just what?

320
00:15:24,270 --> 00:15:25,550
After you were gone,

321
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,670
she wasn't very happy.

322
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,270
She misses you a lot.

323
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:32,080
Qin.

324
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,750
We all miss you.

325
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,150
Son.

326
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:52,080
You have to make your mom happy for me.

327
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,200
If she's unhappy,

328
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,320
I'll hold you responsible.

329
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:29,720
Talking to your partner
from the future again?

330
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,030
The case is solved.

331
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,200
Just sharing the good news.

332
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,960
Ever since you brought
that walkie-talkie home,

333
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,790
you've been using it more than Ming.

334
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:43,390
I'm starting to get jealous
of a walkie-talkie.

335
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,120
Come here.

336
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,000
Luoxia.

337
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,000
In the future,

338
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,550
no matter what happens,

339
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:15,960
whether I'm here or not,

340
00:17:17,310 --> 00:17:19,160
you have to live a happy life.

341
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:20,640
All right?

342
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,750
You have to be here.

343
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:31,960
Dad.

344
00:17:33,790 --> 00:17:34,270
What is it?

345
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:34,590
Son.

346
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:38,000
Why are you up?

347
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,790
What's wrong?

348
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,240
Dad.

349
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:43,350
I tried calling you
several times just now,

350
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:45,160
but you didn't answer.

351
00:17:45,830 --> 00:17:46,640
Really?

352
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:48,270
I'm sorry, Ming.

353
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:50,270
From now on, I'll

354
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:52,400
call you once every day, okay?

355
00:17:55,830 --> 00:17:57,160
Don't come so early next time,

356
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:57,750
okay?

357
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,000
(Longfan Urban Construction General Manager
Huo Qicheng Found Dead)

358
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,260
(White-Haired Female Body
Found on City Outskirts)

359
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:43,045
(Victim Identified as Jin Juan)

360
00:18:43,045 --> 00:18:44,820
(Wife of Longfan Urban Construction Group
General Manager Huo Qicheng)

361
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:55,880
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

362
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:03,730
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

363
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:11,820
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

364
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:17,680
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

365
00:19:19,710 --> 00:19:27,670
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

366
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:33,350
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

367
00:19:35,390 --> 00:19:43,700
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

368
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:49,550
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

369
00:19:51,010 --> 00:19:59,130
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

370
00:19:59,820 --> 00:20:04,860
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

371
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:14,680
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

372
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:22,230
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

373
00:20:22,430 --> 00:20:26,840
♪Can you hear me?♪

374
00:20:26,850 --> 00:20:30,640
♪Can you hear me?♪

375
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:38,100
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

376
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:45,840
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

377
00:20:46,170 --> 00:20:51,780
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

378
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:57,260
♪After all these years♪

379
00:20:59,770 --> 00:21:07,250
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

380
00:21:08,150 --> 00:21:09,450
♪And tell you♪

381
00:21:10,670 --> 00:21:13,940
♪I haven't let you down♪
